Digest and size of the bundled schemas of the common structure of the Czech
health insurers (author: Všeobecná zdravotní pojišťovna ČR), pinned by hand.

THE NAME IS NOT THE VALIDITY. "2025_v8" is the authority's own file name for
the structure in force FROM 1 January 2026, the first year in which both
forms are filed only electronically; the fixed header text of each document
reads "… 2026+". There is no separate "2026" file to look for.

WHY: each file stamps itself with a Revision and a Date in an
xsd:documentation annotation, and each document carries a fixed GUID
(identifikacePredmetuPodaniKod) that changes with the structure. Both are
honest signals, but nothing here validates the annotation, and a schema
revised in place would still load. Only this file makes a refresh visible.

REFRESH PROCEDURE
  1. Download the two sample packages the Česká průmyslová zdravotní
     pojišťovna publishes on https://cpzp.cz/formulare (and on
     https://cpzp.cz/clanek/921-0-Oznamovaci-povinnost-pro-platce.html):
     "Vzorový soubor XML + XSD (ZIP)" for the Přehled o platbě pojistného
     and for the Hromadné oznámení zaměstnavatele. Each holds the XSD under
     the authority's file name and a sample XML.
  2. Compare the XSDs with data/PPPZ_2025_v8.xsd and data/HOZ_2025_v8.xsd
     byte for byte. Judge a download by its CONTENT: the OZP's page links
     the same file names, and on 2026-11-21 both links answered 200 with
     the same 50 kB HTML page.
  3. If either moved: read the Revision / Date annotation and the "platná
     od" line, replace the file, update the digest and size above; a new
     structure (a new GUID, a new file name) is a new
     cssk.payroll.declaration.version record with its own template.
  4. The VZP publishes no changelog; diff the two XSDs.

